        <section>
            <h2>About Vietnamese Cuisine</h2>

            <p>
                Vietnamese cuisine is famous for its fresh ingredients,
                balanced flavors and diverse dishes. 
                Here are three popular Vietnamese foods that are loved
                by both Vietnamese people and international visitors.
            </p>
        </section>


        <section>
            <h2>Famous Foods</h2>

            <ol>
                <li>
                    <h3>Phở</h3>
                    <p>
                        Phở is one of the most famous Vietnamese dishes.
                        It is a noodle soup served with beef or chicken,
                        fresh herbs and a flavorful broth.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <h3>Bánh mì</h3>
                    <p>
                        Bánh mì is a Vietnamese sandwich made with a crispy
                        baguette, meat, vegetables, herbs and special sauces.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <h3>Bánh xèo</h3>
                    <p>
                        Bánh xèo is a crispy Vietnamese pancake made from
                        rice flour, filled with shrimp, pork and bean sprouts.
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </section>


